{
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "Oho? Climbin' all the way up empty-handed? Bold!\nCome on, pick somethin' from the pile, you'll cut 'em down faster!",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Accept",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "I trust these hands. Still... you've got what I need.",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "Ha! Good eye! Business should always be this easy!",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "Back again? I've been holdin' this pile for ya.",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "Well well, a regular customer! Got some new shinies...\nAnd a few old stories too — even about Neow's little doin's.\nBut those are old secrets. We just do business.",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Pry",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "...You know more than you say. But you never spill.",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "DARV.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "Smart one. Secrets rest safest at the bottom of a pile.\nTake your goods and be off.",

  "NEOW.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "I am ready.",
  "NEOW.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[sine]...your... moves...\n...landings... all at your command...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...kill... the... Architect...\n...your... wish...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.char": "Why were you at the bottom of the tower, the first time I saw you?",
  "NEOW.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.ancient": "[sine]...this tower... was... mine...\n...go... up... for me...[/sine]",

  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "An empty-handed fighter?! All the way up here?!\nAmazing! So fun!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Show",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "The technique itself is the training. Landings come as I will them.",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "[jitter]Hm...[/jitter] The way you move. Like a fine machine.",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "New moves?! Show me again! Quick!",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "Still tangled with the Architect?\nHow about... try talking to him? Talking is better than fighting!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Respond",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "He burned my home. Some words only a blade can say.",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "OROBAS.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "Hmm. Then take this. A little extra edge!",

  "PAEL.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Your rhythm is wound too tight...\nSit, breathe with me, and go...[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Listen",
  "PAEL.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "Even between breaths, there is technique.",
  "PAEL.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "PAEL.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Good... You already see stillness as a kind of strength.[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Back again... Don't disturb my sleep...[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Take a piece of my flesh...\nThe road to the top is too heavy...[/thinky_dots]",

  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "[b]Oi, empty-handed warrior! Take this!![/b]",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Take it",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "Thanks. But I trust these hands more.",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "[b]Ha! Bold! Then come fight me with those fists!![/b]",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[b]Warrior! Show me your fists!![/b]",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[b]Stronger already?! Then let's fight! An honorable match!![/b]",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Fight",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "As you wish.",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "TANX.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[b]Magnificent! That was worth it!![/b]",

  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "Well now, a rare visitor? An empty-handed fighter? What a dear!",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Respond",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "I'm no dear. The blade only falls when it must.",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "Heh, then let auntie make you shine a bit more.\nWant to [gold]burn[/gold] once?",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "My little one's back? Let auntie [pink]brighten[/pink] your flame a little~",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "Welcome back, sweetie. Did you [pink]brighten[/pink] the tower's top?",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Respond",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "I go up to kill him. Not for you.",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "Oh, don't rush off, dear.\n[i][font_size=22]Tezcatara smiles warmly, nails digging into her palm.[/font_size][/i]",

  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "Mortal technique is never [sine]perfect[/sine].\nGive me your 'heart', and I'll teach you [pink]completion[/pink].",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Retort",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "Completion? If a strike isn't true, what use is completion.",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "Stubborn mortal... Then sign a contract. I get you to the top, you settle an old grievance of mine.",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "Come to your senses? My offer only opens once.",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "The Architect woke and shattered my [pink]skull[/pink]. I hate him. So do you. We're kin.\nSign, and your odds grow.",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Refuse",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "I hate — but not to walk someone's road. If I must make a pact, I write its terms with these hands.",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[i][font_size=22][sine]Hah...[/sine][/font_size][/i]\nMortals always say they don't regret. Then carry your flaw onward.",

  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "Come forward, martial mortal. Let me see if this [pink]flesh[/pink] deserves my blessing.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Step forward",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "Perfection lies in the landing, not the skin.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "How curious... You suit my taste more than those little parts. Let me [pink]refine[/pink] this frame.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "My little warrior, do not let that frame shame this gift.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "The Architect has gone mad, hasn't he? What a pity... Had the blight I wove with Neow burned wilder, he'd never have risen this far.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "Pry",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "The blight... was yours?",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "Ah, I've said too much.\nCome, child. Accept my blessing and go up for me.",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "And a mortal like you dares step into my workshop?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Answer",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "Only to find a truer path.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "A path? Hmph. You are merely a breathing construct.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "Back for death? My memory holds.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "Respond",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "I climb to cut your arrogance down myself.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "Arrogance? A gnat speaks of cutting?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "Neow's pawn. Always a pawn.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "Respond",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "Pawn or curse, I walk my own road.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.GAOSHOU_CHARACTER_GAOSHOU_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "Hmph. Ridiculous. Be gone, gnat."
}
